@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create enquiry (pricing — should match SOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Priya Sharma",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "subject": "Growth plan pricing",
  "message": "Can you share pricing for three seats on the Growth plan?"
}

### Create enquiry (no SOP — auto-escalate)
# @name createEscalated
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Walk-in Lead",
  "channel": "web_chat",
  "subject": "General",
  "message": "Just browsing today."
}

### History — replace enquiry id after create
GET {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/REPLACE_ENQUIRY_ID/history

### Follow-up
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/REPLACE_ENQUIRY_ID/follow-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Also need SSO on Growth — is that included?"
}

### Manual escalate
POST {{baseUrl}}/enquiry/REPLACE_ENQUIRY_ID/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested supervisor callback"
}
